entry.summary:
Detached DOM nodes and uncollected closures are silent performance killers in single-page applications.
I built leak-doctor — an open-source, zero-dependency diagnostic engine and headless Chromium auditor leveraging WeakRef and FinalizationRegistry to detect frontend memory leaks in real-time.
🌐 Live Web Scanner: leak-doctor-web.vercel.app

🧪 Interactive Playground: leak-doctor-playground.vercel.app

🐙 GitHub Repository: github.com/mmy-lana/leak-doctor






  📦 Official npm Packages




@leak-doctor/profiler — Core WeakRef Memory Profiling Engine
@leak-doctor/toolbar — Shadow DOM Dev Widget
@leak-doctor/shared — Shared Diagnostic Schemas & Formatters
